worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_00.js"
  ceiling 925
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1297 to 1299 for the timezone-places seed cache this shard declares and invalidates while shard 09 reads it (entity-grounded hours batch); a duplicated reset line was removed. Ceiling moved 1299 to 1300 for issue #1021 R1021-6: hydrateLinoSeedText ends by learning the program tasks the worker tables lack from data/seed/hello-world-programs.lino (installSeedProgramTasks in formal_ai_worker_program_requests.js), so copy stdin to stdout is a catalogued task in the browser as it is in Rust. Lowered to 1253 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the bootstrap copies of the brainstorm and persona seeds are gone; both fill from data/seed when the seed loads. Lowered to 1208 the same day: the concept request leads, question starts and articles are seed cue records (conceptQueryCues), and the bootstrap concept prefix and suffix lists are gone. Ceiling moved 1208 to 1232: normalizePrompt rewrites the seeded contracted token pairs of data/seed/languages.lino into their expansions (expandSeededContractions, issue #1175 p020, 2026-10-08), so `you're` meets a surface the seed writes as `you are`; the Rust twin is expand_contractions in rust/src/engine.rs. Ceiling moved 1232 to 1233 (2026-10-08, issue #1165 R1165-6): hydrateLinoSeedText also calls installDocumentedLanguageCommands (formal_ai_worker_documented_commands.js), so a catalog row takes each check or run command a captured documentation page states from that page, as program_languages does in Rust. Lowered from 1233 to 925 on 2026-10-08 for R1188-U1: the bootstrap copies of the intent routes (with their multilingual phrases) and of the unknown answer left, the worker reads both from the hydrated seed."
